{"4553110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "NEVER LOOK BACK", "steam_appid": 4553110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553110/extras/383736ec834136e7f236fa7ec204707b.avif?t=1788343237\" width=848 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEVER LOOK BACK</strong> is a psychological rule-based horror where you descend the infinite office staircase, follow the Architect's rules, and try not to let the Darkness overtake you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The staircase will test you: changing items' places, breaking the space, and releasing the ones you don't want to meet. You'll need to spot the anomaly and go further. Every mistake draws the Darkness closer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have a rubber duck in your hands. Squeeze it when you're afraid: it will help you relax and continue descending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553110/extras/0cdbff0a2874cc79a6be993a5f49aae4.poster.avif?t=1788343237\" width=1170 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553110/extras/0cdbff0a2874cc79a6be993a5f49aae4.webm?t=1788343237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553110/extras/0cdbff0a2874cc79a6be993a5f49aae4.mp4?t=1788343237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>While descending, you'll have to:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Listen to the Architect and remember the rules</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Think about how to pass each anomaly</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Hold your fear back with a rubber duck</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Don't look back, even if there's something behind you</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DREAM ATMPOSPHERE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our world, in a dreamcore aesthetic, seems familiar, beautiful, and scary at the same time. You don't want to leave it, just like a pleasant dream. But beauty is just an illusion. Sometimes the quietest place becomes a trap.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553110/extras/d1d0265b1566d0fd6372fb7ae4912382.poster.avif?t=1788343237\" width=1170 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553110/extras/d1d0265b1566d0fd6372fb7ae4912382.webm?t=1788343237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553110/extras/d1d0265b1566d0fd6372fb7ae4912382.mp4?t=1788343237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVERY ANOMALY HAS ITS OWN RULES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The staircase doesn't repeat itself. Anomalies can smash you, push you back, provoke the Darkness, or begin following you because of a wrong glance. Some of them pretend to be a usual part of the staircase until you make a mistake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Architect will explain the rules. But you'll have to go through the dangers by yourself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DUCK IS YOUR ANTISTRESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you start to feel fear, squeeze your rubber duck: it will help you relax and continue descending. But its squeaks attract the Darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lower you descend, the harder it is to decide when to squeeze the duck and when you should be patient.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553110/extras/37ac9e1e94be1f42c6d8da3d8e1ff77d.poster.avif?t=1788343237\" width=1170 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553110/extras/37ac9e1e94be1f42c6d8da3d8e1ff77d.webm?t=1788343237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553110/extras/37ac9e1e94be1f42c6d8da3d8e1ff77d.mp4?t=1788343237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ■ Rule-based psychological horror</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ■ Liminal office staircase and <i>dreamcore</i> aesthetic locations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ■ The threat behind your back gets closer with every mistake</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ■ An antistress duck as a way to hold your fear back</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ■ More than <strong>30 anomalies</strong> with different survival rules</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ The Architect - a voice that leads you through the procedure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ The main rule: <strong>never look back</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553110/extras/383736ec834136e7f236fa7ec204707b.avif?t=1788343237\" width=848 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEVER LOOK BACK</strong> is a psychological rule-based horror where you descend the infinite office staircase, follow the Architect's rules, and try not to let the Darkness overtake you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The staircase will test you: changing items' places, breaking the space, and releasing the ones you don't want to meet. You'll need to spot the anomaly and go further. Every mistake draws the Darkness closer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have a rubber duck in your hands. Squeeze it when you're afraid: it will help you relax and continue descending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553110/extras/0cdbff0a2874cc79a6be993a5f49aae4.poster.avif?t=1788343237\" width=1170 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553110/extras/0cdbff0a2874cc79a6be993a5f49aae4.webm?t=1788343237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553110/extras/0cdbff0a2874cc79a6be993a5f49aae4.mp4?t=1788343237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>While descending, you'll have to:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Listen to the Architect and remember the rules</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Think about how to pass each anomaly</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Hold your fear back with a rubber duck</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Don't look back, even if there's something behind you</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DREAM ATMPOSPHERE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our world, in a dreamcore aesthetic, seems familiar, beautiful, and scary at the same time. You don't want to leave it, just like a pleasant dream. But beauty is just an illusion. Sometimes the quietest place becomes a trap.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553110/extras/d1d0265b1566d0fd6372fb7ae4912382.poster.avif?t=1788343237\" width=1170 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553110/extras/d1d0265b1566d0fd6372fb7ae4912382.webm?t=1788343237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553110/extras/d1d0265b1566d0fd6372fb7ae4912382.mp4?t=1788343237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVERY ANOMALY HAS ITS OWN RULES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The staircase doesn't repeat itself. Anomalies can smash you, push you back, provoke the Darkness, or begin following you because of a wrong glance. Some of them pretend to be a usual part of the staircase until you make a mistake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Architect will explain the rules. But you'll have to go through the dangers by yourself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DUCK IS YOUR ANTISTRESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you start to feel fear, squeeze your rubber duck: it will help you relax and continue descending. But its squeaks attract the Darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lower you descend, the harder it is to decide when to squeeze the duck and when you should be patient.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553110/extras/37ac9e1e94be1f42c6d8da3d8e1ff77d.poster.avif?t=1788343237\" width=1170 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553110/extras/37ac9e1e94be1f42c6d8da3d8e1ff77d.webm?t=1788343237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553110/extras/37ac9e1e94be1f42c6d8da3d8e1ff77d.mp4?t=1788343237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ■ Rule-based psychological horror</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ■ Liminal office staircase and <i>dreamcore</i> aesthetic locations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ■ The threat behind your back gets closer with every mistake</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ■ An antistress duck as a way to hold your fear back</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ■ More than <strong>30 anomalies</s